#: includes/admin/class-modules-page.php:66
#: includes/admin/class-modules-page.php:81
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "Mòduls"

#: includes/admin/class-modules-page.php:82
msgid ""
"Each module adds one feature to the site. A module that is off loads "
"nothing, and turning it off does not delete anything it saved: turning it on "
"again brings it back as it was."
msgstr ""
"Cada mòdul afegeix una funció al web. Un mòdul desactivat no carrega res, i "
"desactivar-lo no esborra res del que va desar: quan el tornes a activar, "
"torna tal com estava."

