msgstr "Mostra els punts"

#: modules/carousel/blocks/carousel/edit.js:76
msgid "Loop"
msgstr "En bucle"

#: modules/carousel/blocks/carousel/edit.js:77
msgid ""
"After the last slide, go back to the first one (and from the first to the "
"last)."
msgstr ""
"Després de l'última diapositiva, torna a la primera (i de la primera, a "
"l'última)."

#: modules/carousel/blocks/carousel/edit.js:81
msgid "Visible on mobile"
msgstr "Visibles al mòbil"

#: modules/carousel/blocks/carousel/edit.js:82
