#: modules/carousel/module.php
msgctxt "module name"
msgid "Carousel"
msgstr "Carrusel"

#: modules/carousel/module.php
msgctxt "module description"
msgid ""
"Carousel block: a horizontal scrolling row of any blocks (or the posts of a "
"Query) with arrows, optional dots, infinite loop and autoplay only if asked "
"for."
msgstr ""
"Bloc de carrusel: una fila amb desplaçament horitzontal de qualsevol bloc (o "
"les entrades d'una consulta), amb fletxes, punts opcionals, bucle infinit i "
"reproducció automàtica només si es demana."

#: modules/comments-off/module.php
msgctxt "module name"
msgid "No comments"
msgstr "Sense comentaris"

#: modules/comments-off/module.php
msgctxt "module description"
msgid ""
"Turns comments off everywhere: closed on every post, no Comments menu, "
"dashboard widget or toolbar item, no comment blocks on the site and no "
"comment feeds."
msgstr ""
"Desactiva els comentaris a tot el web: tancats a totes les entrades, sense "
"el menú Comentaris, el giny del tauler ni l'element de la barra d'eines, "
"sense blocs de comentaris al web i sense canals de comentaris."

#: modules/comments-off/module.php:146
msgid "Comments are closed."
msgstr "Els comentaris estan tancats."

#: modules/consent/blocks/consent/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Cookie settings link"
msgstr "Enllaç de configuració de les galetes"

#: modules/consent/blocks/consent/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Reopens the cookie consent notice. Renders nothing when the site declares no "
"optional cookie categories."
msgstr ""
"Torna a obrir l'avís de galetes. No mostra res si el lloc no declara "
"categories de galetes opcionals."

#: modules/consent/blocks/consent/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "consent"
msgstr "consentiment"

#: modules/consent/blocks/consent/block.json
#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "cookies"
msgstr "galetes"

#: modules/consent/blocks/consent/block.json
#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "gdpr"
msgstr "rgpd"

#: modules/consent/blocks/consent/block.json
#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "privacy"
msgstr "privadesa"

#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Cookie table"
msgstr "Taula de galetes"

#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Table of the site's cookies grouped by category (name, provider, purpose and "
"duration), from the list confirmed in Estrategia Web → Cookies. For the "
"cookie policy page."
msgstr ""
"Taula de les galetes del web per categoria (nom, proveïdor, finalitat i "
"durada), treta de la llista confirmada a Estrategia Web → Galetes. Per a la "
"pàgina de la política de galetes."

#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "policy"
msgstr "política"

#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/labels.php:8
msgid "Category (empty: all)"
msgstr "Categoria (buit: totes)"

#: modules/consent/blocks/cookie-table/labels.php:9
msgid "Heading level of each category"
msgstr "Nivell del títol de cada categoria"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:59
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:156
#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:527
#: modules/matomo/includes/class-admin-fields.php:41
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:69
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "No tens permís per fer això."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:129
#: modules/forms/includes/admin/class-submissions-table.php:115
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Pendent"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:130
msgid "Confirmed"
msgstr "Confirmada"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:131
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Ignorada"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:158
msgid "Changes saved."
msgstr "S'han desat els canvis."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:158
msgid "Cookie deleted."
msgstr "S'ha suprimit la galeta."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:160
msgid ""
"Not saved: check the cookie name (exact name, or a prefix ending in *) and "
"that the list is not full."
msgstr ""
"No s'ha desat: revisa el nom de la galeta (el nom exacte, o un prefix acabat "
"en *) i que la llista no estigui plena."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:163
msgid ""
"The active theme brings its own cookie notice: these settings do not apply "
"to it."
msgstr ""
"El tema actiu porta el seu propi avís de galetes: aquests paràmetres no s'hi "
"apliquen."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:166
msgid "Cookie notice"
msgstr "Avís de galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:171
msgid "Categories the notice asks about"
msgstr "Categories per les quals pregunta l'avís"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:180
msgid "declared by the code (theme or a module)"
msgstr "la declara el codi (el tema o un mòdul)"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:185
msgid ""
"Changing the categories shows the notice again to every visitor: they are "
"being asked about something new. Without any category, the notice does not "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Canviar les categories torna a mostrar l'avís a tots els visitants: se'ls "
"pregunta per una cosa nova. Sense cap categoria, l'avís no surt."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:189
msgid "Cookie detector"
msgstr "Detector de galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:193
msgid ""
"When a visitor accepts cookies, their browser sends the NAMES (never the "
"values) of the cookies it sees on this site, at most once a week or when the "
"list changes. New names appear below as pending."
msgstr ""
"Quan un visitant accepta les galetes, el seu navegador envia els NOMS (mai "
"els valors) de les galetes que veu en aquest web, com a màxim un cop per "
"setmana o quan canvia la llista. Els noms nous surten a sota com a pendents."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:198
msgid "Save notice settings"
msgstr "Desa els paràmetres de l'avís"

#. translators: 1: category name, 2: list of cookie names.
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:214
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The notice does not ask about «%1$s», but these confirmed cookies belong to "
"it: %2$s. Either the notice should ask about it (above), or the cookies "
"should not be set."
msgstr ""
"L'avís no pregunta per «%1$s», però aquestes galetes confirmades són "
"d'aquesta categoria: %2$s. O l'avís pregunta per ella (a dalt), o aquestes "
"galetes no s'haurien de posar."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:222
msgid "Cookies of this site"
msgstr "Galetes d'aquest web"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:223
msgid ""
"Only confirmed cookies appear in the cookie table of the policy (block "
"«Cookie table» or shortcode [estrategia_web_cookie_table]). Proposals come "
"from our own list and from the Open Cookie Database: check them. A name "
"ending in * covers every cookie that starts like that."
msgstr ""
"Només les galetes confirmades surten a la taula de galetes de la política "
"(bloc «Taula de galetes» o codi curt [estrategia_web_cookie_table]). Les "
"propostes surten de la nostra llista i de l'Open Cookie Database: revisa-"
"les. Un nom acabat en * cobreix totes les galetes que comencen així."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:224
msgid ""
"The cookies «Declared by the plugin» belong to third-party services that the "
"active modules load (the Google map, Google tags, Matomo): the detector "
"cannot see the ones set on the provider’s own domain, and sees the rest only "
"after a visitor accepts. To leave one out of the policy, mark it Ignored: if "
"you delete it, it comes back as a proposal while its module still loads the "
"service."
msgstr ""
"Les galetes marcades «Declarada pel plugin» són de serveis de tercers que "
"carreguen els mòduls actius (el mapa de Google, les etiquetes de Google, "
"Matomo): el detector no veu les que es posen al domini del mateix proveïdor, "
"i la resta només les veu quan un visitant accepta. Per deixar-ne una fora de "
"la política, marca-la com a Ignorada: si la suprimeixes, torna com a "
"proposta mentre el seu mòdul continuï carregant el servei."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:228
msgid "Confirm all pending proposals"
msgstr "Confirma totes les propostes pendents"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:234
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:163
msgid "Cookie"
msgstr "Galeta"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:236
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:312
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Categoria"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:237
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:313
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:164
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Proveïdor"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:238
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:314
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:165
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Finalitat"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:239
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:315
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:166
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Durada"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:240
msgid "Seen"
msgstr "Vista"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:241
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Accions"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:246
msgid ""
"No cookies yet. They appear when a visitor accepts the notice, or add them "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Encara no hi ha galetes. Surten quan un visitant accepta l'avís, o afegeix-"
"les a sota."

#. translators: %s: a concrete cookie name.
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:257
#, php-format
msgid "e.g. %s"
msgstr "p. ex. %s"

#. translators: %s: name of a third-party service, e.g. «Google Maps (map block)».
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:276
#, php-format
msgid "Declared by the plugin: %s"
msgstr "Declarada pel plugin: %s"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:279
msgid ""
"Its module no longer loads this service: delete the cookie if the site does "
"not use it any more."
msgstr ""
"El seu mòdul ja no carrega aquest servei: suprimeix la galeta si el web ja "
"no l'usa."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:284
msgid "Added by hand"
msgstr "Afegida a mà"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:287
msgid "Proposal: Open Cookie Database"
msgstr "Proposta: Open Cookie Database"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:289
msgid "Proposal: Estrategia Web"
msgstr "Proposta: Estrategia Web"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:297
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Desa"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:298
#: modules/forms/includes/admin/class-submissions-table.php:39
#: modules/forms/includes/admin/class-submissions-table.php:86
#: modules/redirects/includes/admin/class-tables.php:56
#: modules/redirects/includes/admin/class-tables.php:90
#: modules/redirects/includes/admin/class-tables.php:149
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Suprimeix"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:306
msgid "Add a cookie by hand"
msgstr "Afegeix una galeta a mà"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:307
msgid ""
"For third-party cookies the detector cannot see and no module declares (for "
"example, a video or a chat embedded by hand). Empty fields are filled with "
"the proposal, if there is one."
msgstr ""
"Per a les galetes de tercers que el detector no pot veure i que cap mòdul no "
"declara (per exemple, un vídeo o un xat inserits a mà). Els camps buits "
"s'omplen amb la proposta, si n'hi ha."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:311
#: modules/social/includes/class-admin.php:90
#: modules/social/includes/class-admin.php:131
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:315
msgid ""
"Like «2 years», «30 minutes» or «session» to have it translated "
"automatically; anything else is shown as written."
msgstr ""
"Com ara «2 years», «30 minutes» o «session» perquè es tradueixi tot sol; "
"qualsevol altra cosa surt tal com s'escriu."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:317
msgid "Add cookie"
msgstr "Afegeix la galeta"

#. translators: 1: link to the Open Cookie Database, 2: licence name, 3: date.
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:324
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Proposals use data from the %1$s, licensed under %2$s (extract of %3$s)."
msgstr ""
"Les propostes fan servir dades de l'%1$s, amb llicència %2$s (extracte del "
"%3$s)."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:266
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analítica"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:267
msgid "Help us understand how the site is used."
msgstr "Ens ajuden a entendre com s'utilitza el lloc."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:270
msgid "Maps and third-party content"
msgstr "Mapes i contingut de tercers"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:271
msgid ""
"Load embedded maps and other content served by third parties, which may set "
"their own cookies."
msgstr ""
"Carreguen mapes i altre contingut servit per tercers, que poden instal·lar "
"les seves pròpies galetes."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:274
msgid "Advertising"
msgstr "Publicitat"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:275
msgid "Measure campaigns and show relevant advertising."
msgstr "Mesuren campanyes i mostren publicitat rellevant."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:278
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferències"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:279
msgid ""
"Remember choices that change how the site behaves or looks, such as the "
"region or recently viewed items."
msgstr ""
"Recorden eleccions que canvien com funciona o com es veu el web, com ara la "
"regió o el que has vist darrerament."

#. translators: %s: name of the company that built the site (a brand, not translated).
#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:375
#, php-format
msgid "Powered by %s"
msgstr "Powered by %s"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:408
msgid ""
"Cookie notice: detector on or off, and categories added by the administrator."
msgstr ""
"Avís de galetes: detector activat o desactivat i categories que afegeix "
"l'administrador."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:435
msgid "Link text (empty: “Cookie settings”)"
msgstr "Text de l'enllaç (buit: «Configura les galetes»)"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:508
msgid ""
"We use our own and third-party cookies for the purposes listed below. You "
"can accept them, reject them or choose which ones to allow. Necessary "
"cookies are always active."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzem galetes pròpies i de tercers per a les finalitats que s'indiquen. "
"Les pots acceptar, rebutjar o triar quines permets. Les galetes necessàries "
"sempre estan actives."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:531
msgid "Privacy and cookie policy"
msgstr "Política de privadesa i galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:537
msgid "Cookie categories"
msgstr "Categories de galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:540
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:53
msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Necessàries"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:540
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:54
msgid ""
"Required for the site to work, including remembering this choice. Always "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Imprescindibles perquè el lloc funcioni, també per recordar aquesta elecció. "
"Sempre actives."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:556
msgid "Save choices"
msgstr "Desa la selecció"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:560
msgid "Accept all"
msgstr "Accepta-les totes"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:561
msgid "Reject all"
msgstr "Rebutja-les totes"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:562
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Configura"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:567
#: modules/external-links/includes/class-external-links.php:101
#: modules/map/blocks/map/render.php:343 modules/map/blocks/map/render.php:347
#: modules/social/blocks/social-links/render.php:74
#: modules/whatsapp/blocks/whatsapp/render.php:74
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(s'obre en una pestanya nova)"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:594
msgid ""
"Cookie settings: this site declares no optional cookie categories, so there "
"is no notice to reopen and this link is not shown."
msgstr ""
"Configura les galetes: aquest lloc no declara categories de galetes "
"opcionals, així que no hi ha cap avís per tornar a obrir i l'enllaç no es "
"mostra."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-consent.php:600
msgid "Cookie settings"
msgstr "Configura les galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:139
msgid "This website"
msgstr "Aquest lloc web"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:144
msgid "Remembers your choice in the cookie notice."
msgstr "Recorda la teva elecció a l'avís de galetes."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:150
msgid ""
"Previous name of the cookie that remembers your choice in the cookie notice; "
"it is replaced on the next visit."
msgstr ""
"Nom anterior de la galeta que recorda la teva elecció a l'avís de galetes; "
"se substitueix a la visita següent."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:156
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:162
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:168
msgid "Remembers the language in which you are browsing the site."
msgstr "Recorda l'idioma en què navegues pel web."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:174
msgid "Checks that the browser accepts cookies. Only on the login page."
msgstr "Comprova que el navegador accepta galetes. Només a la pàgina d'accés."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:180
msgid "Keeps the session of the site’s users (editors and administrators)."
msgstr "Manté la sessió dels usuaris del web (editors i administradors)."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:186
msgid ""
"Remembers the dashboard settings of the site’s users (editors and "
"administrators)."
msgstr ""
"Recorda els paràmetres del tauler dels usuaris del web (editors i "
"administradors)."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:195
msgid ""
"Statistics: recognises a returning visitor (an anonymous identifier). Only "
"after accepting analytics."
msgstr ""
"Estadístiques: reconeix un visitant que torna (amb un identificador anònim). "
"Només després d'acceptar l'analítica."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:201
msgid "Statistics: groups the pages viewed in the same visit."
msgstr "Estadístiques: agrupa les pàgines vistes en una mateixa visita."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:207
msgid "Statistics: remembers the website the visitor came from."
msgstr "Estadístiques: recorda des de quin web va arribar el visitant."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:213
msgid "Statistics: remembers that analytics cookies were accepted."
msgstr "Estadístiques: recorda que es van acceptar les galetes d'analítica."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:219
msgid ""
"Remembers your name and email for the next comment, only if you ask for it."
msgstr ""
"Recorda el teu nom i el teu correu per al pròxim comentari, només si ho "
"demanes."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:360
msgid ""
"Invalid cookie name. Use the exact name, or a prefix ending in * for a "
"family of cookies (e.g. _ga_*)."
msgstr ""
"El nom de la galeta no és vàlid. Fes servir el nom exacte, o un prefix "
"acabat en * per a una família de galetes (p. ex. _ga_*)."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-registry.php:365
msgid "The cookie list is full. Delete the cookies you do not need."
msgstr "La llista de galetes és plena. Suprimeix les que no necessitis."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:87
msgid "Google (google.com), only if the map is shown"
msgstr "Google (google.com), només si es mostra el mapa"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:93
msgid "Google Maps (map block)"
msgstr "Google Maps (bloc de mapa)"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:98
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:104
msgid ""
"Google may set it when the map loads: it remembers preferences such as the "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Google la pot posar en carregar el mapa: recorda preferències com l'idioma."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:110
msgid "Google may set it when the map loads: it detects spam, fraud and abuse."
msgstr ""
"Google la pot posar en carregar el mapa: detecta correu brossa, frau i "
"abusos."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:116
msgid ""
"Google may set it when the map loads: it stores the choice made about "
"Google’s own cookies."
msgstr ""
"Google la pot posar en carregar el mapa: desa l'elecció feta sobre les "
"galetes del mateix Google."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:126
msgid "Google Analytics (Google tags module)"
msgstr "Google Analytics (mòdul d'etiquetes de Google)"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:131
msgid ""
"Statistics: distinguishes one visitor from another. Only after accepting "
"analytics."
msgstr ""
"Estadístiques: distingeix un visitant d'un altre. Només després d'acceptar "
"l'analítica."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:137
msgid ""
"Statistics: keeps the state of the visit. Only after accepting analytics."
msgstr ""
"Estadístiques: desa l'estat de la visita. Només després d'acceptar "
"l'analítica."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:146
msgid "Google Ads (Google tags module)"
msgstr "Google Ads (mòdul d'etiquetes de Google)"

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:151
msgid ""
"Advertising: measures the conversions that come from ads. Only after "
"accepting advertising."
msgstr ""
"Publicitat: mesura les conversions que arriben des dels anuncis. Només "
"després d'acceptar la publicitat."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:157
msgid ""
"Advertising: remembers the ad click that brought the visitor, to measure the "
"conversion. Only after accepting advertising."
msgstr ""
"Publicitat: recorda el clic a l'anunci que va portar el visitant, per "
"mesurar la conversió. Només després d'acceptar la publicitat."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:163
msgid ""
"Advertising: Google uses it to show and measure ads on other websites. Only "
"after accepting advertising."
msgstr ""
"Publicitat: Google la usa per mostrar i mesurar anuncis en altres webs. "
"Només després d'acceptar la publicitat."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:169
msgid ""
"Advertising: Google checks whether the browser accepts cookies. Only after "
"accepting advertising."
msgstr ""
"Publicitat: Google comprova si el navegador accepta galetes. Només després "
"d'acceptar la publicitat."

#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-services.php:178
msgid "Matomo, hybrid mode (Matomo module)"
msgstr "Matomo, mode híbrid (mòdul Matomo)"

